WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Today you put the roots to work.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.650
In Spelling, the words are new.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.350
Build each describing word in your head before you place it.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:13.220
If the base ends in a silent e, check whether it stays or goes.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.490
The footprint game works the same way.
